# Panharmonicon ("If an artifact or creature entering causes a triggered ability ... to trigger, that ability triggers an
# additional time", CR 603.2d) beside Torpor Orb ("Creatures entering don't cause abilities to trigger", CR 603.2): Cryogen Relic,
# an artifact and no creature, enters and its "when this artifact enters" triggers twice, two cards. Kitchen Finks, a creature,
# causes nothing to trigger, so there is nothing for Panharmonicon to add to: no life is gained.
# Hand: 7 - 6 played on turn 1 = 1 (the Relic); turn 3 draws a Forest (2), plays it and the Relic (0) and draws Kitchen Finks and
# an Island (2); turn 5 draws a Forest (3), plays it and Finks: the Island is left.

